{"version":1,"content":"<p>任達華、盧慧敏及內地演員此沙首次合作，拍攝電影《偵戰》。</p><p>3人均表示拍攝過程愉快，戲外相處融洽。</p><p>不過，盧慧敏為揣摩角色，休息時的一些舉動曾令兩位男士困惑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.765435+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T12:44:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_hash":"6639bd65d7450dcf9abe1d6a3a0233beae35e012b7bc64c83070172f269cce87","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}